@startuml http_session_model_configuration
title HTTP Session Model and Deep-Thinking Confirmed Configuration

' Source evidence (pi-mono commit 086c32e74530564922d011ade23ff582c9d63116):
' packages/coding-agent/src/core/agent-session.ts, setModel and setThinkingLevel,
' lines 1586-1600 and 1684-1730
' packages/ai/src/types.ts, Model, lines 793-809
' packages/ai/src/models.ts, getSupportedThinkingLevels, lines 900-910
' Source evidence (pi-mono-java commit 8691e8800f05f28afe22499050c29220ef5b7475):
' modules/coding-agent-cli/src/main/java/com/campusclaw/codingagent/runtimeapi/session/RuntimeSessionConfigurationService.java.
' modules/coding-agent-cli/src/main/java/com/campusclaw/codingagent/runtimeapi/web/RuntimeSessionConfigurationController.java.
' modules/coding-agent-cli/src/main/java/com/campusclaw/codingagent/runtimeapi/model/CatalogRuntimeModelManager.java.
' Observed behavior: both pi baselines can list models and change the active model.
' Their thinkingLevel values control model reasoning effort.
' Confirmed product constraint: HTTP thinking is a boolean deep-thinking switch; false maps to off,
' while true maps to a managed non-off level supported by the current model and Agent.
' Security hardening: model discovery is Session-scoped and exposes only model_id;
' raw reasoning content is never enabled by the public deep-thinking switch.
' Architecture change: HTTP configuration writes require an idle Session and a matching ETag.
' Design reason: prevent a configuration change from racing with an active execution while
' returning the common Session resource after every successful mutation.

skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName Arial
skinparam defaultFontSize 12
skinparam sequence {
  ArrowColor #475569
  ActorBorderColor #475569
  ActorFontColor #0F172A
  LifeLineBorderColor #94A3B8
  LifeLineBackgroundColor #F8FAFC
  ParticipantBorderColor #475569
  ParticipantBackgroundColor #F8FAFC
  ParticipantFontColor #0F172A
  GroupBorderColor #64748B
  GroupFontColor #334155
}
skinparam note {
  BackgroundColor #FFF7ED
  BorderColor #C2410C
  FontColor #7C2D12
}

actor Caller
participant "Credential\nAdapter" as Auth
participant "Session Configuration\nAPI" as API
database "Runtime Session\nStore" as Store
participant "Model Manager" as Models
participant ResultBeanAdapter

group List available models
  Caller -> Auth : GET /sessions/{session_id}/models
  Auth -> API : immutable CallerAuthContext
  API -> Store : read Agent binding and current model_id
  Store --> API : agent_id, enabledModels, current model_id
  API -> Models : list callable models for Agent
  Models --> API : ordered model_id string array
  API -> ResultBeanAdapter : normal(ModelListResponseVO)
  ResultBeanAdapter --> API : resCode, resMsg, result
  API --> Caller : 200 OK\ncurrent_model_id and models string array
end

group Change current model
  Caller -> Auth : PUT /sessions/{session_id}/model\nIf-Match and model_id
  Auth -> API : immutable CallerAuthContext
  API -> Store : require idle and compare ETag
  Store --> API : current Session resource
  API -> Models : resolve target model
  Models --> API : authoritative model and reasoning capability
  opt target model does not support deep thinking
    API -> API : normalize thinking to false
  end
  API -> Store : atomically update model, thinking, and ETag
  Store --> API : updated Session resource and ETag
  API -> ResultBeanAdapter : normal(SessionResponseVO)
  ResultBeanAdapter --> API : resCode, resMsg, result
  API --> Caller : 200 OK\nSession resource and ETag
end

group Change future deep-thinking default
  Caller -> Auth : PUT /sessions/{session_id}/thinking\nIf-Match and boolean thinking
  Auth -> API : immutable CallerAuthContext
  API -> Store : require idle and compare ETag
  Store --> API : current Session resource
  opt requested value is true
    API -> Models : verify current model supports reasoning
    Models --> API : managed non-off level or 422
  end
  API -> Store : atomically update deep-thinking switch and ETag
  Store --> API : updated Session resource and ETag
  API -> ResultBeanAdapter : normal(SessionResponseVO)
  ResultBeanAdapter --> API : resCode, resMsg, result
  API --> Caller : 200 OK\nSession resource and ETag
end

note over API,Models
The public models field is a string array of model_id values.
Names and display metadata come from the caller model catalog.
The current model can be absent when it was disabled later.
end note

note over API,Models
thinking controls whether deep thinking is enabled.
It never authorizes raw reasoning-content disclosure.
The change applies only to executions accepted afterward.
end note
@enduml
